    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96544" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στερέμνι-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Aret.
			<u>SD</u>
			2.10
		</span></i>:— <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στερεός</span>
			, <i>hard, fast, firm</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					2.11.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Epin.</u>
					981d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠτειλαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					1.10c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ς</span>. <i>solid</i> food,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>BKT</u>
				3p.20
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ς</span>. <i>solid
				objects</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1pp.9
			</span></i>, al. U. (also sg., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Nat.</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>, al.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πύκνωμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>D.</u>
					3.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ -ώτερα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. κίνησις</span>
			<i>stable</i> motion, <i><span class="en">
				Bito
				60.7
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίως</span>
			<i>firmly</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῖμαξ ς.
			ἐνδεδεμένη</span> ibid., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Alim.</u>
				5
			</span></i>.</div>
